id: pm-pfqi
title: Consolidate the 8 list-* status variants into pm list --status (list-all/open/draft/in-progress/blocked/closed/canceled become hidden aliases)
description: "list, list-all, list-draft, list-open, list-in-progress, list-blocked, list-closed, list-canceled collapse to pm list with --status (multi-value) and --all; the 7 variant spellings become alias-table entries. Duplicate check: pm-gdi7 touches list-closed projection verbosity only; no consolidation item exists."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 1
tags[3]: agent-ux,"area:cli",simplification
