author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: pm list --status <s...> and --all cover every variant behavior incl. per-variant defaults; all 8 old spellings still work via alias shim with identical output; help shows only pm list; contracts/MCP/completions/docs regenerated; existing list-* tests pass unchanged against aliases
